\~\~\~
:::

## Conclusion

This configuration represents years of incremental refinement. The modular
structure makes it easy to enable or disable features without breaking
everything, and keeping keybindings in a single file makes them discoverable.
Emacs rewards investment, the more you shape it to your workflow, the more it
becomes an extension of thought rather than a tool you fight against.

